        "mission_title": "Mission",
        "mission_text": "At Nithya Amirtham, our mission is straightforward but passionate—deliver exceptional food that enhances moods and enriches celebrations. We aim to be everywhere there is a need for quality sweets and reliable catering, from intimate family gatherings to large-scale corporate events.",
