        "celebration_heading": "Celebrating Our Food, Celebrating Life",
        "celebration_paragraph_1": "<p>At Nithya Amirtham, food is not just an offering — it's a festival on a plate. Every dish tells a story. Every ingredient is chosen with care. Whether it's a hearty sambar, a festive pongal, or a comforting rasam, we celebrate the power of food to heal, connect, and uplift.</p>",
        "celebration_paragraph_2": "<p>We don't just deliver products — we deliver moments of joy. We cherish our role in your kitchens, celebrations, and family dinners. Because we know food is how we express love, care, and community.</p>",
        "celebration_image": "shopify://shop_images/life.png"
      }
    },
